    "media:imagetext": "NellEngland\nCV-580\nWelcome aboard Air New England's CV-580. Dependable arcraft and experienced\ncrews are synonymous with Air New England's endeavor to make your flight a safe\nand comfortable experience.\nWe do not anticipate\nany disruption of normal flight, but we\nwish to acquaint\nyou with the equipment and the facilities which Air New England has provided for\nyour safety.\nIn all instances your flight crew, who have been thoroughly trained and drilled\nin emergency procedures, will direct and\nassist you, if necessary, in leaving the\naircraft rapidly and safely.\nPlease Do Not Remove This Card From The Aircraft\nFRONT\nWINDOW\nEXITS\nREAR\nENTRANCE A\nShall not be used as\nan exit unless directed by a crew member\nDOOR\nWITH\nEXIT\nSLIDE\nWINDOW EXITS\nGrasp handle inside\nslot over window.\nPull in and down.\nLift window. Turn on\nside and throw out.\nFace rear of cabin.\nIf over wing, step out,\nsit down on rear of wing\nand slide to ground.\nIf not over wing, pull\nescape rope from top of\nwindow trame, climb out\nwindow feet first\nor slide to ground.\nREAR DOOR EXIT\nTurn handle to the\nrear and up.\nPush door out to open.\nPull red handle to\ninflate slide.\nMove away from aircraft quickly\n(OVER)\nRemove high heel\nshoes- jump onto\nslide with feet up.",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787967343,
